<title>USA: St Paul hogs off $0.50-1.00 - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Paul hogs off $0.50-1.00 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST PAUL 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $0.50 to 1.00 lower than Wednesday's close. Top $59.50 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3     220-250 lbs    59.00-59.50</p>
<p>	     250-260 lbs    58.50-59.50</p>
<p>	     260-270 lbs    57.50-58.50</p>
<p>US 2-3     270-280 lbs    56.50-57.50</p>
<p>US 2-4     280-290 lbs    55.50-56.50</p>
<p>US 3-4     290-300 lbs    54.50-55.50</p>
<p>Sows: 0.50 to 1.50 lower. Top 49.50.</p>
<p>US 1-3     300-500 lbs   47.50-48.00</p>
<p>	     500-550 lbs   48.00-49.00</p>
<p>	     550-700 lbs   49.00-49.50</p>
